OL,3,GNEWSADespair for student paramedics as
OL,4,Avacancies drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudent paramedics have expressed their
OL,7,Ffrustration after being told that about
OL,8,Fhalf of them will not be able to find
OL,9,Fjobs in the UK when they qualify.
OL,11,FThe Royal College of Paramedics (RCOP)
OL,12,Fsaid up to 50% of about 2,400 new
OL,13,Fparamedic registrants this year may not
OL,14,Fprogress into professional roles when
OL,15,Fthey finish their university education.
OL,17,FSpeaking on condition of anonymity one
OL,18,Fstudent paramedic told the BBC that
OL,19,Ftrying to find work after their degree
OL,20,Fhad been "awful".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
