OL,3,GNEWSADespair for student paramedics as
OL,4,Avacancies drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne ambulance service told the BBC it
OL,7,Frecognised there was an oversupply of
OL,8,Fgraduates, while the Department of
OL,9,FHealth and Social Care (DHSC) said this
OL,10,Fyear had seen "record numbers of
OL,11,Fambulance staff".
